OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F412A1787417315
OL,3,CTeam NI athletes given 'unbelievable'
OL,4,Cwelcome home
OL,6,FStormont will host a special reception
OL,7,Fon Wednesday night for the 65 athletes
OL,8,Fwho travelled to Glasgow to compete in
OL,9,Fthis year's Commonwealth Games.
OL,11,FIt was Northern Ireland's second
OL,12,Flargest medal haul at the Games just
OL,13,Fbehind Birmingham four years ago.
OL,15,FThe Team NI were welcomed back to
OL,16,FBelfast by legendary former athlete
OL,17,FLady Mary Peters.
OL,19,FBowler Chloe Wilson said it was
OL,20,F"unbelievable".
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,413,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F412A1787417315
OL,3,CTeam NI athletes given 'unbelievable'
OL,4,Cwelcome home
OL,6,FShe continued: "I couldn't believe she
OL,7,Fwas even watching us playing bowls!
OL,9,F"You don't think people of that
OL,10,Fstature is going to be there, so,
OL,11,Fabsolutely delighted to have her
OL,12,Fwelcome us home again tonight."
OL,14,FLady Mary Peters told UTV: "I had such
OL,15,Fa good time at the Games watching them
OL,16,Fall competing, and particularly the
OL,17,Fbowlers.
OL,19,F"I did bowl for a year, I know how
OL,20,Ftechnical it is, and they were all
OL,21,Fstars.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,413,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F412A1787417315
OL,3,CTeam NI athletes given 'unbelievable'
OL,4,Cwelcome home
OL,6,F"We're just amazed at their successes
OL,7,Fand so proud of every one of them.
OL,9,F"And those that didn't get medals will
OL,10,Fget them next time round, because
OL,11,Fthey've had the experience of going to
OL,12,Fa Commonwealth Games."
OL,14,FKate O'Connor took home the first gold
OL,15,Fmedal of the Games for NI.
OL,17,FShe is also the first to win gold in
OL,18,Fthe multi-event since Lady Mary Peters
OL,19,Fin 1972.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,413,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F412A1787417315
OL,3,CTeam NI athletes given 'unbelievable'
OL,4,Cwelcome home
OL,6,FLady Mary Peters said: "She was
OL,7,Fsensational!"
OL,9,F"She did everything that she could
OL,10,Fhave and more.
OL,12,F"And particularly ending up with an
OL,13,F800-meter, the time she ran, I hadn't
OL,14,Fto do that in my competition, and I'm
OL,15,Fvery grateful!
OL,17,F"But she is an absolute star, she
OL,18,Fperforms well, she looks well on the
OL,19,Ftrack, and she has a new Commonwealth
OL,20,Frecord, and what more can you ask for?"
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
