PN,41205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F412A1787417315
OL,3,CTeam NI athletes given 'unbelievable'
OL,4,Cwelcome home
OL,6,FFor gold medal boxer Jon McConnell,
OL,7,Fhis summer could have been very
OL,8,Fdifferent.
OL,10,FHe was offered an interview after
OL,11,Fapplying for the famous dating show
OL,12,FLove Island, but turned it down to go
OL,13,Fto the Commonwealth Games.
OL,15,FJon McConnell said: "It paid off, the
OL,16,Fdecision."
OL,18,FHe continued: "Maybe I would have got
OL,19,Fput out in the round of 16, or I would
OL,20,Fhave went, 'Mmm, maybe I should have
OL,21,Fwent on it.'
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,413,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F412A1787417315
OL,3,CTeam NI athletes given 'unbelievable'
OL,4,Cwelcome home
OL,6,F"Maybe I'd get a bit more coverage
OL,7,Fthere, but no, I made the right
OL,8,Fdecision.
OL,10,F"Next summer they can hit me up!"
OL,12,FFor the first time, the entire bowls
OL,13,Fteam came home with medals.
OL,15,FShauna O'Neill and Chloe Wilson won
OL,16,Fbronze together, and Gary Kelly and
OL,17,FAdam McKeown topped the men's pairs
OL,18,Fwith gold.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,413,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F412A1787417315
OL,3,CTeam NI athletes given 'unbelievable'
OL,4,Cwelcome home
OL,6,FGary Kelly said: "It's a pinnacle to
OL,7,Four sport, you know. It's where we get
OL,8,Fthe most exposure with media.
OL,10,F"Just getting, new audience, new
OL,11,Fviewers to our sport.
OL,13,F"And obviously it was a new format
OL,14,Fthis time around, it was indoor.
OL,16,F"So there were changes, and we just
OL,17,Fhope that sort of shorter, sharp
OL,18,Fformat has encouraged more people to
OL,19,Fwatch it, enjoy it, and maybe even
OL,20,Fhopefully take it up."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/7
